    "summary": "Complete TypeScript prop signatures, dependency matrix, and category index for all 48 components.",
    "body": "Every component exports both its React component function and its TypeScript props interface (`<ComponentName>Props`) from `@motionfoundry/ui`.\n\n### Dependency Matrix Across the 48 Components\n\n- **Pure React + CSS / SVG / Canvas (No `motion` required)**: `GlyphCascade`, `OrbitingWords`, `VelocityButton`, `ConstellationCard`, `LiquidGlassCard`, `MorphingBorder`, `InfiniteMarquee`, `FluidMeshBackground`, `NoiseAurora`, `OrbitingParticles`, `LiquidBlob`, `ScrollVelocityProgress`.\n- **Motion for React (`motion/react`) Primitives**: `KineticType`, `TextMorph`, `AuroraHeadline`, `MagneticButton`, `ElasticPressButton`, `HoloTiltCard`, `PortalRevealPanel`, `ScrollNarrative`, `ParallaxDepthScene`, `MagneticDock`, `MorphingCommandPalette`, `StaggeredGridReveal`.\n- **Studio Kit — Pure React + CSS (No `motion` required)**: `ShimmerText`, `ShinyBorderButton`, `Meteors`, `BeamLines`, `GridPulse`, `OrbitLoader`, `PulseLoader`.\n- **Studio Kit — Motion for React**: `BlurInText`, `Typewriter`, `NumberTicker`, `SplitReveal`, `RotatingWords`, `ConfettiButton`, `LoadingButton`, `SlideFillButton`, `ToggleSwitch`, `AnimatedCheckbox`, `FlipCard`, `SwipeCards`, `RevealCard`, `DrawBorderCard`, `NotificationStack`, `ReorderList`, `ExpandableSearch`.\n\nThe per-component prop tables live on each component page under the **Props** tab.",
    "code": "import type {\n  KineticTypeProps,\n  GlyphCascadeProps,\n  TextMorphProps,\n  OrbitingWordsProps,\n  AuroraHeadlineProps,\n  MagneticButtonProps,\n  VelocityButtonProps,\n  ElasticPressButtonProps,\n  ConstellationCardProps,\n  LiquidGlassCardProps,\n  HoloTiltCardProps,\n  MorphingBorderProps,\n  PortalRevealPanelProps,\n  InfiniteMarqueeProps,\n  ScrollNarrativeProps,\n  ParallaxDepthSceneProps,\n  FluidMeshBackgroundProps,\n  NoiseAuroraProps,\n  OrbitingParticlesProps,\n  LiquidBlobProps,\n  MagneticDockProps,\n  ScrollVelocityProgressProps,\n  MorphingCommandPaletteProps,\n  StaggeredGridRevealProps,\n  // Studio Kit\n  BlurInTextProps,\n  RotatingWordsProps,\n  ConfettiButtonProps,\n  FlipCardProps,\n  SwipeCardsProps,\n  NotificationStackProps,\n  ReorderListProps,\n} from \"@motionfoundry/ui\";"
