    "body": "MotionFoundry avoids bouncy, distracting consumer animations in favor of critically damped springs and crisp exponential easing (`[0.16, 1, 0.3, 1]`).\n\n### Recommended Spring & Easing Presets\n\n- **Micro-Interactions (`MagneticButton`, `ElasticPressButton`)**: `stiffness: 230–380`, `damping: 14–18`, `mass: 0.4–0.45`.\n- **Spatial Surfaces (`HoloTiltCard`, `ParallaxDepthScene`, `MagneticDock`)**: `stiffness: 200–320`, `damping: 22`.\n- **Command & Layout Indicators (`MorphingCommandPalette`, `TextMorph`)**: `stiffness: 280–360`, `damping: 24–28`.",
    "code": "export const MOTIONFOUNDRY_SPRINGS = {\n  snappy: { type: \"spring\", stiffness: 320, damping: 24, mass: 0.4 },\n  elasticPress: { type: \"spring\", stiffness: 380, damping: 14, mass: 0.45 },\n  editorialEase: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] as [number, number, number, number],\n};"
